# Aura Data Mapping Public Stewardship Licence

Copyright (c) Luke Hayes / Aura of Intelligence. All rights reserved except as allowed below.

This is a plain-language stewardship licence for the Aura Data Mapping public website and source repo. It is written for an exploratory data-mapping interface, not as a generic software product licence.

## 1. What This Repo Is

This repository contains Aura Data Mapping, a standalone public version of the Aura Builder idea where facets in a 12 x 24 Aura field can hold quick-access data records.

The app includes the seven Aura layers, inside/private and outside/public shells, flat and horn-torus navigation, local browser storage, JSON import/export, interface code, labels, visual design, and related documentation.

Nothing in this repo should be treated as a finished security, privacy, encryption, scheduling, data-governance, crypto, legal, financial, medical or production infrastructure product unless Luke Hayes explicitly says so.

## 2. Non-Commercial Public Use

You may view, share links to, clone, study, reference and adapt this repo for personal, community, educational, artistic, research, public-interest or other non-commercial purposes.

This includes learning from the Aura field navigation pattern, adapting the interface structure for your own non-commercial mapping work, and using the repo as inspiration for public-interest data access tools.

When practical, please credit Aura of Intelligence and Luke Hayes, and link back to the original project:

https://auraofintelligence.github.io/aura-data-mapping/

