## 4. User Data And Local Outputs

The app currently stores mapping data in your own browser localStorage and can export JSON files.

Aura Data Mapping claims no ownership over mapping records that you create for yourself. You are responsible for what you put into the map, what you export, and where you share it.

Do not use this public prototype to store secrets, private keys, medical records, legal records, passwords, production credentials or other sensitive material.

## 5. Code, Forms And Mapping Structures

The code, interface forms and mapping structures are shared so people can learn from the approach and adapt it for non-commercial creative, educational, research or public-interest work.

If you improve the public infrastructure, fix bugs, or develop useful patterns from it, please share useful notes, fixes or improvements back to the commons where reasonable.

Do not sell this repo, its templates, its builder system, or close copies of its planning or mapping infrastructure as a standalone product.

## 6. Honest Provenance

If you adapt non-commercial parts of this repo, keep the provenance clear.

Do not remove attribution in a way that makes the work look like it originated elsewhere. Do not use the Aura of Intelligence name, logo, language, screenshots or planning material to imply endorsement, partnership, sponsorship or approval without written permission.

